  -- into one levy because NEW 2026 DEBTORS (the source of truth for these two, per the
  -- estate's own description of that sheet) only reports them as one combined figure.
  -- Catalog 'amount' is the estate's fixed/standard rate for that levy (confirmed by the
  -- treasurer) - individual invoices still carry their own amount from the sheet, which
  -- can differ (e.g. a multi-property owner's combined dues, a partial/short payment).
  -- Donation has no fixed rate (ad hoc), so stays at 0.
  -- No '2024/2025 Arrears' levy: that carried-over debt is already folded into the
  -- 'Security Fee + Yearly Devt. Levy' invoice amount sourced from NEW 2026 DEBTORS -
  -- a separate arrears invoice would double-count it in the resident's total outstanding.

